{"id": "68423", "title": "擒久见人心", "author": "夜湮", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 57, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68423.htm", "intro": "这是一个剩女被闺蜜抢走优质男后，发愤图强做女强人，最后被自家boss拐回家结婚生宝宝的故事。\r\n\r\n有一天春和日暖，钟清河摸着肚子忽然想起一个严肃的问题：“如果我现在决定离开你，是不是可以考虑要一大笔离婚赔偿？”\r\n顾梓城缓然微笑：“你认为和我上法庭，你能赢过我？”\r\n看到小女人默然模样，顾梓城索性放下手中的案卷：“为了鼓励你的出师，我把自己赔给你怎么样？稳赚不赔。”", "base": "files/article/html/68/68423", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "10528381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10528382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10528383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10528384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10528385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10528386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10528387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10528388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10528389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10528390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10528391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10528392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10528393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10528394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10528395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10528396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "10528397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "10528398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "10528399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "10528400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "10528401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "10528402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "10528403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "10528404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十五章", "file": "10528405.h